---
import Landing from "../../layouts/Landing.astro"
---

<Landing title="Local-First Data Ownership — Buddy" robots="noindex, follow">
  <main class="ownership-gallery-page">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="gallery-header">
        <span class="badge">DESIGN STUDY</span>
        <h1>Yours to Keep</h1>
        <p>60 visual concepts showcasing local-first data ownership, offline sovereignty, nature-inspired protection, abstract safety shapes, and panda safety metaphors.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Part 1: Product & Device Metaphors -->
      <h2 class="section-divider-title">01. Product & Device Metaphors</h2>
      <div class="grid-container">
        
        <!-- Concept 01: The Isolated Laptop -->
        <div class="card" tabindex="0">
          <div class="card-visual">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 240 200" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <!-- Laptop Frame -->
              <rect x="50" y="60" width="140" height="90" rx="8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" fill="var(--color-bg, #09090b)" />
              <line x1="30" y1="150" x2="210" y2="150" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" />
              <line x1="110" y1="150" x2="130" y2="150" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" opacity="0.6" />

              <!-- Local circulation path on screen -->
              <circle cx="120" cy="100" r="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="3 3" opacity="0.3" />
              <circle r="3" fill="var(--color-accent-primary, #ff6b00)">
                <animateMotion path="M 120,76 A 24,24 0 1,1 119.9,76 Z" dur="3s" repeatCount="indefinite" />
              </circle>

              <!-- External cloud sending lines that bounce off -->
              <path d="M 120,15 C 130,15 140,25 135,35" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.2" />
              <path d="M 120,35 L 120,55" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="3 3" opacity="0.2" />
              
              <!-- Deflector shield line above laptop screen -->
              <path d="M 80,50 Q 120,40 160,50" stroke="var(--color-accent-primary, #ff6b00)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="0.8">
                <animate attributeName="opacity" values="0.3;1;0.3" dur="2s" repeatCount="indefinite" />
              </path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="card-content">
            <h3>01. Isolated Laptop</h3>
            <p>Data circulates exclusively inside the local screen workspace. External cloud connections are physically blocked by an active local shield.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Concept 02: Local Hard Drive Vault -->
        <div class="card" tabindex="0">
          <div class="card-visual">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 240 200" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <!-- Hard Drive Disk Platter -->
              <circle cx="120" cy="100" r="55" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" fill="var(--color-bg, #09090b)" />
              <circle cx="120" cy="100" r="16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" />

              <!-- Reading arm/head -->
              <g transform="translate(120, 100)">
                <g>
                  <line x1="0" y1="0" x2="-48" y2="-28" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" />
                  <polygon points="-48,-28 -44,-32 -52,-32" fill="var(--color-accent-primary, #ff6b00)" />
                  <animateTransform attributeName="transform" type="rotate" values="-10; 15; -10" dur="4s" repeatCount="indefinite" />
                </g>
              </g>

              <!-- Localized sector glow -->
              <circle cx="120" cy="100" r="40" stroke="var(--color-accent-primary, #ff6b00)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="20 180" opacity="0.8">
                <animateTransform attributeName="transform" type="rotate" from="0 120 100" to="360 120 100" dur="2s" repeatCount="indefinite" />
              </circle>

              <!-- Mechanical Lock around the platter -->
              <path d="M 85,95 L 85,80 C 85,60 155,60 155,80 L 155,95" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="0.3" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="card-content">
            <h3>02. Storage Platter Lock</h3>
            <p>A physical disk drive reading arm writes bits locally. A heavy mechanical lock holds the storage assembly secure from external mounts.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Concept 03: The Data Safe -->
        <div class="card" tabindex="0">
          <div class="card-visual">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 240 200" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <!-- Safe Box Frame -->
              <rect x="60" y="45" width="120" height="110" rx="6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" fill="var(--color-bg, #09090b)" />
              
              <!-- Safe Dial lock -->
              <circle cx="120" cy="100" r="22" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" />
              <circle cx="120" cy="100" r="16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="4 4" />
              
              <!-- Indicator notch -->
              <line x1="120" y1="78" x2="120" y2="84" stroke="var(--color-accent-primary, #ff6b00)" stroke-width="2" />

              <g transform="translate(120, 100)">
                <line x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="-12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" />
                <animateTransform attributeName="transform" type="rotate" values="0; 120; 80; 360" keyTimes="0; 0.3; 0.6; 1" dur="6s" repeatCount="indefinite" />
              </g>

              <!-- Circular arrows inside safe walls showing internal movement -->
              <rect x="75" y="60" width="90" height="80" rx="3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="5 15" opacity="0.2" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="card-content">
            <h3>03. Combination Safe</h3>
            <p>Your documents reside inside a heavy-gauge iron vault. The mechanical combination dial turns locally to lock down configuration files.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Concept 04: The Unplugged Cord -->
        <div class="card" tabindex="0">
          <div class="card-visual">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 240 200" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <!-- Computer Monitor -->
              <rect x="60" y="50" width="120" height="80" rx="6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" fill="var(--color-bg, #09090b)" />
              <polygon points="100,130 140,130 150,155 90,155" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" fill="none" />

              <!-- Cord coming out of back and hanging loose -->
              <path d="M 120,110 Q 120,175 75,170" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none" />
              <!-- Plug end with open pins -->
              <g transform="translate(75, 170) rotate(10)">
                <rect x="-8" y="-4" width="8" height="8" rx="1" fill="currentColor" />
                <line x1="-12" y1="-2" x2="-8" y2="-2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" />
                <line x1="-12" y1="2" x2="-8" y2="2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" />
              </g>

              <!-- Internally cycling data spark -->
              <circle r="3" fill="var(--color-accent-primary, #ff6b00)">
                <animateMotion path="M 75,90 L 165,90 L 165,65 L 75,65 Z" dur="4s" repeatCount="indefinite" />
              </circle>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="card-content">
            <h3>04. Unplugged Cable</h3>
            <p>A physical connection cable hangs loose and open on your desk. The application operates in a completely air-gapped sandbox.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Concept 05: Folder Lock Clamped Shut -->
        <div class="card" tabindex="0">
          <div class="card-visual">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 240 200" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <!-- Folder back -->
              <path d="M 45,150 L 45,70 C 45,65 50,60 55,60 L 95,60 L 110,75 L 185,75 C 190,75 195,80 195,85 L 195,150 Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" fill="var(--color-bg, #09090b)" />
              
              <!-- Document sliding into the folder -->
              <g>
                <rect x="75" y="80" width="80" height="50" rx="3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" fill="var(--color-bg, #09090b)" />
                <line x1="85" y1="95" x2="145" y2="95" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.5" />
                <line x1="85" y1="110" x2="125" y2="110" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.5" />
                
                <animateTransform attributeName="transform" type="translate" values="0,15; 0,-15; 0,15" dur="4s" repeatCount="indefinite" />
              </g>

              <!-- Folder front lip -->
              <path d="M 40,150 L 40,90 C 40,88 43,85 47,85 L 193,85 C 197,85 200,88 200,90 L 200,150 Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" fill="currentColor" fill-opacity="0.05" />

              <!-- Padlock locking the folder -->
              <g transform="translate(160, 100)">
                <rect x="-8" y="0" width="16" height="12" rx="1.5" fill="var(--color-accent-primary, #ff6b00)" stroke="none" />
                <path d="M -5,0 L -5,-6 C -5,-10 5,-10 5,-6 L 5,0" stroke="var(--color-accent-primary, #ff6b00)" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none" />
              </g>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="card-content">
            <h3>05. Local Folder Seal</h3>
            <p>Files drop directly into local system directories. An integrated passcode padlock clamps the directory structure shut.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Concept 06: Zero-Account Direct Entry -->
        <div class="card" tabindex="0">
          <div class="card-visual">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 240 200" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <!-- Window interface representing "No Sign In" -->
              <rect x="50" y="45" width="140" height="110" rx="6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" fill="var(--color-bg, #09090b)" />
              <line x1="50" y1="70" x2="190" y2="70" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" />
              <circle cx="65" cy="58" r="3" fill="currentColor" />
              <circle cx="75" cy="58" r="3" fill="currentColor" />
              <circle cx="85" cy="58" r="3" fill="currentColor" />

              <!-- User avatar silhouette with a slash (No profiles) -->
              <circle cx="120" cy="100" r="12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" />
              <path d="M 105,122 C 105,115 110,112 120,112 C 130,112 135,115 135,122" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" />
              <line x1="95" y1="125" x2="145" y2="95" stroke="var(--color-accent-primary, #ff6b00)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" />

              <!-- Direct Unlock arrow -->
              <path d="M 80,105 L 70,105 L 70,125 L 85,125" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.3" />
              <polygon points="85,121 93,125 85,129" fill="currentColor" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="card-content">
            <h3>06. Zero-Account Access</h3>
            <p>No user login pages, no profile registrations, and no credential handshakes. The editor loads directly from the local disk.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Concept 07: Home Boundary Shield -->
        <div class="card" tabindex="0">
          <div class="card-visual">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 240 200" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <!-- House contour enclosing local database -->
              <path d="M 60,150 L 60,100 L 120,50 L 180,100 L 180,150 Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" fill="var(--color-bg, #09090b)" />

              <!-- Database cylinders inside house -->
              <g transform="translate(120, 115)">
                <ellipse cx="0" cy="-15" rx="18" ry="5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" />
                <ellipse cx="0" cy="0" rx="18" ry="5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" />
                <path d="M -18,-15 L -18,15 A 18,5 0 0,0 18,15 L 18,-15" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none" />
                <ellipse cx="0" cy="15" rx="18" ry="5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" />
                <line x1="-18" y1="0" x2="-18" y2="15" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" />
                <line x1="18" y1="0" x2="18" y2="15" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" />
              </g>

              <!-- External signals bouncing off roof -->
              <path d="M 30,80 Q 75,40 120,35" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="4 4" opacity="0.2" />
              <path d="M 120,35 L 130,45" stroke="var(--color-accent-primary, #ff6b00)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="card-content">
            <h3>07. Home Boundary Shield</h3>
            <p>Your database stays enclosed within physical home boundaries. External requests bounce off the roofline and dissolve.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Concept 08: Direct Device-to-Device Link -->
        <div class="card" tabindex="0">
          <div class="card-visual">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 240 200" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <!-- Laptop (Left) -->
              <rect x="35" y="75" width="60" height="40" rx="3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" />
              <line x1="25" y1="115" x2="105" y2="115" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" />

              <!-- Mobile Phone (Right) -->
              <rect x="155" y="65" width="35" height="65" rx="5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" />
              <circle cx="172.5" cy="120" r="2.5" fill="currentColor" />

              <!-- Connecting physical cable path -->
              <path d="M 95,110 C 115,110 115,85 155,85" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none" />

              <!-- Floating files/pulses on cable -->
              <circle r="3" fill="var(--color-accent-primary, #ff6b00)">
                <animateMotion path="M 95,110 C 115,110 115,85 155,85" dur="3s" repeatCount="indefinite" />
              </circle>

              <!-- Cloud crossed out at top -->
              <g opacity="0.2">
                <path d="M 110,35 C 105,35 100,40 100,45 C 95,45 92,50 95,55 C 95,60 125,60 125,55 C 128,50 125,45 120,45 C 120,40 115,35 110,35 Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" />
                <line x1="90" y1="30" x2="135" y2="65" stroke="var(--color-accent-primary, #ff6b00)" stroke-width="2" />
              </g>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="card-content">
            <h3>08. Local Sync Cable</h3>
            <p>Data transfers directly between adjacent peer devices over local cables. Cloud servers are completely bypassed and crossed out.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Concept 09: The Offline Sandbox -->
        <div class="card" tabindex="0">
          <div class="card-visual">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 240 200" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <!-- Closed Box/Sandbox walls -->
              <polygon points="120,40 190,75 190,145 120,180 50,145 50,75" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" fill="var(--color-bg, #09090b)" />
              
              <!-- Inner walls -->
              <line x1="120" y1="40" x2="120" y2="180" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.3" />
              <line x1="50" y1="75" x2="120" y2="110" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.3" />
              <line x1="190" y1="75" x2="120" y2="110" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.3" />

              <!-- Recycled flow particles staying inside sandbox -->
              <circle r="3.5" fill="var(--color-accent-primary, #ff6b00)">
                <animateMotion 
                  path="M 120,60 L 160,80 L 160,130 L 120,150 L 80,130 L 80,80 Z" 
                  dur="4s" 
                  repeatCount="indefinite" 
                />
              </circle>
              <circle r="2.5" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.6">
                <animateMotion 
                  path="M 120,60 L 80,80 L 80,130 L 120,150 L 160,130 L 160,80 Z" 
                  dur="4s" 
                  begin="2s"
                  repeatCount="indefinite" 
                />
              </circle>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="card-content">
            <h3>09. Sealed Sandbox</h3>
            <p>The code interpreter runs inside a sealed virtual sandbox. Files cycle internally through secure loops and never leak outside.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Concept 10: Zero-Tracking shield -->
        <div class="card" tabindex="0">
          <div class="card-visual">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 240 200" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <!-- Profile Silhouette -->
              <circle cx="120" cy="90" r="15" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" />
              <path d="M 95,125 C 95,112 105,108 120,108 C 135,108 145,112 145,125" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" />

              <!-- Defensive Shield surrounding profile -->
              <path d="M 80,80 C 80,60 160,60 160,80 C 160,130 120,155 120,155 C 120,155 80,130 80,80 Z" stroke="var(--color-accent-primary, #ff6b00)" stroke-width="2.5" fill="none" />

              <!-- Scanning laser targeting lines fading away -->
              <g opacity="0.15">
                <line x1="30" y1="60" x2="70" y2="80" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" />
                <line x1="30" y1="120" x2="70" y2="110" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" />
                <line x1="210" y1="60" x2="170" y2="80" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" />
                <line x1="210" y1="120" x2="170" y2="110" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" />
              </g>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="card-content">
            <h3>10. Zero-Tracking Shield</h3>
            <p>Telemetry nodes are deactivated. Analytical scan lines fade away and dissolve before they can catalog your workspaces.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Concept 11: Grounded Database Anchor -->
        <div class="card" tabindex="0">
          <div class="card-visual">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 240 200" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <!-- Database icon at top -->
              <g transform="translate(120, 65)">
                <ellipse cx="0" cy="-12" rx="20" ry="5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" fill="var(--color-bg, #09090b)" />
                <path d="M -20,-12 L -20,12 A 20,5 0 0,0 20,12 L 20,-12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" fill="none" />
                <ellipse cx="0" cy="0" rx="20" ry="5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" fill="none" />
                <ellipse cx="0" cy="12" rx="20" ry="5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" fill="none" />
              </g>

              <!-- Heavy Anchor deep in ground keeping it local -->
              <line x1="120" y1="85" x2="120" y2="135" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" />
              <g transform="translate(120, 140)">
                <path d="M -20,-10 C -20,15 20,15 20,-10" stroke="var(--color-accent-primary, #ff6b00)" stroke-width="3.5" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" />
                <line x1="0" y1="-10" x2="0" y2="5" stroke="var(--color-accent-primary, #ff6b00)" stroke-width="3" />
                <circle cx="0" cy="-14" r="5" fill="var(--color-bg, #09090b)" stroke="var(--color-accent-primary, #ff6b00)" stroke-width="2" />
              </g>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="card-content">
            <h3>11. Grounded Database</h3>
            <p>Database engines are compiled to run locally. An iron tether anchors your dataset permanently down onto the motherboard.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Concept 12: Offline Mode Switch -->
        <div class="card" tabindex="0">
          <div class="card-visual">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 240 200" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <!-- Offline Toggle Switch (ON) -->
              <rect x="70" y="80" width="100" height="40" rx="20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" fill="var(--color-bg, #09090b)" />
              <circle cx="140" cy="100" r="14" fill="var(--color-accent-primary, #ff6b00)">
                <animate attributeName="cx" values="140; 100; 140" dur="5s" repeatCount="indefinite" />
              </circle>

              <!-- Cut network connection line below -->
              <path d="M 50,150 L 105,150 M 135,150 L 190,150" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="0.3" />
              <line x1="105" y1="150" x2="135" y2="150" stroke="var(--color-accent-primary, #ff6b00)" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="3 3" opacity="0.8">
                <animate attributeName="opacity" values="0.8;0.1;0.8" dur="2s" repeatCount="indefinite" />
              </line>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="card-content">
            <h3>12. Offline Switch</h3>
            <p>A mechanical toggle forces offline operation. Cloud telemetry pipelines are physically severed and disconnected.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Concept 13: Local File Ring -->
        <div class="card" tabindex="0">
          <div class="card-visual">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 240 200" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <!-- Central Laptop representing Host -->
              <rect x="85" y="80" width="70" height="45" rx="3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" fill="var(--color-bg, #09090b)" />
              <line x1="70" y1="125" x2="170" y2="125" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3.5" />

              <!-- Orbital safety boundary -->
              <circle cx="120" cy="105" r="55" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="4 4" opacity="0.2" />

              <!-- Orbiting local document files -->
              <g>
                <rect x="-8" y="-6" width="16" height="12" rx="1.5" fill="var(--color-bg, #09090b)" stroke="var(--color-accent-primary, #ff6b00)" stroke-width="1.5" />
                <line x1="-4" y1="-2" x2="4" y2="-2" stroke="var(--color-accent-primary, #ff6b00)" stroke-width="1" />
                <animateMotion path="M 120,50 A 55,55 0 1,1 119.9,50 Z" dur="4s" repeatCount="indefinite" />
              </g>
              <g>
                <rect x="-8" y="-6" width="16" height="12" rx="1.5" fill="var(--color-bg, #09090b)" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" />
                <line x1="-4" y1="-2" x2="4" y2="-2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" />
                <animateMotion path="M 120,50 A 55,55 0 1,0 119.9,50 Z" dur="6s" repeatCount="indefinite" />
              </g>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="card-content">
            <h3>13. Local Orbit</h3>
            <p>Documents orbit strictly around the host machine icon, never crossing the outer dotted safety boundary.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Concept 14: Sealed Memory Platter -->
        <div class="card" tabindex="0">
          <div class="card-visual">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 240 200" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <!-- Multi-track memory circles -->
              <circle cx="120" cy="100" r="55" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.15" />
              <circle cx="120" cy="100" r="40" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.2" />
              <circle cx="120" cy="100" r="25" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.3" />

              <!-- Write heads writing in loops -->
              <path d="M 120,45 L 120,75" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" opacity="0.4" />
              <path d="M 120,125 L 120,155" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" opacity="0.4" />

              <!-- Sectors lighting up locally -->
              <circle cx="120" cy="60" r="3" fill="var(--color-accent-primary, #ff6b00)">
                <animate attributeName="opacity" values="0.2;1;0.2" dur="2s" repeatCount="indefinite" />
              </circle>
              <circle cx="140" cy="100" r="3.5" fill="var(--color-accent-primary, #ff6b00)">
                <animate attributeName="opacity" values="1;0.2;1" dur="2s" repeatCount="indefinite" />
              </circle>
              <circle cx="100" cy="100" r="3" fill="currentColor">
                <animate attributeName="opacity" values="0.1;0.9;0.1" dur="1.5s" repeatCount="indefinite" />
              </circle>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="card-content">
            <h3>14. Memory Platter</h3>
            <p>Integrated state managers read and write data blocks directly to active RAM partitions, bypassing central servers.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Concept 15: The Faraday Computer -->
        <div class="card" tabindex="0">
